Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Minemora - optimize MoveThroughVillageGoal

MoveThroughVillageGoal#canUse is one of the most expensive vanilla goal checks:
RandomPos#generateRandomPos runs ten iterations and each candidate performs a
radius-10 PoiManager#find, followed by up to three full A* passes through
PathNavigation#createPath. A mob that cannot reach a village POI re-runs all of
that on every goal selector tick, forever.

This adds an exponential failure back-off (the situation that makes the check
fail does not change within a tick) plus an optional fixed interval gate.
Both are configured through performance.minemora.* and default to vanilla.

Raider$RaiderMoveThroughVillageGoal is a separate class and is not affected,
so raids keep vanilla behaviour.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/goal/MoveThroughVillageGoal.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/goal/MoveThroughVillageGoal.java
index 990a48550fc285dfcbaa536c87be781e3c68195f..bfffc698d81ee5ed96fb39d326759a8330e305ea 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/goal/MoveThroughVillageGoal.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/goal/MoveThroughVillageGoal.java
@@ -45,8 +45,49 @@ public class MoveThroughVillageGoal extends Goal {
         }
     }
 
+    // Minemora start - optimize MoveThroughVillageGoal
+    private final int minemora$interval = Math.max(1, org.dreeam.leaf.config.modules.opt.MinemoraTweaks.moveThroughVillageInterval);
+    private int minemora$counter;
+    private int minemora$retryDelay;
+    private int minemora$nextCheckTick;
+
     @Override
     public boolean canUse() {
+        // Back-off: canUse() is one of the most expensive vanilla goal checks (up to ten
+        // radius-10 POI searches plus one to three full A* passes). A mob that fails it
+        // fails for a reason that does not change within a tick, so stop re-running it
+        // every tick and grow the retry delay while it keeps failing.
+        if (this.mob.tickCount < this.minemora$nextCheckTick) {
+            return false;
+        }
+
+        if (this.minemora$interval > 1) {
+            this.minemora$counter++;
+            if (this.minemora$counter < this.minemora$interval) {
+                return false;
+            } else {
+                this.minemora$counter = this.mob.getRandom().nextInt(this.minemora$interval);
+            }
+        }
+
+        final boolean minemora$canUse = this.minemora$canUse();
+        if (minemora$canUse) {
+            this.minemora$retryDelay = 0;
+            this.minemora$nextCheckTick = 0;
+        } else {
+            final int minemora$min = org.dreeam.leaf.config.modules.opt.MinemoraTweaks.moveThroughVillageRetryMin;
+            if (minemora$min > 0) {
+                final int minemora$max = Math.max(minemora$min, org.dreeam.leaf.config.modules.opt.MinemoraTweaks.moveThroughVillageRetryMax);
+                this.minemora$retryDelay = this.minemora$retryDelay <= 0 ? minemora$min : Math.min(minemora$max, this.minemora$retryDelay << 1);
+                this.minemora$nextCheckTick = this.mob.tickCount + this.minemora$retryDelay;
+            }
+        }
+
+        return minemora$canUse;
+    }
+
+    private boolean minemora$canUse() {
+        // Minemora end - optimize MoveThroughVillageGoal
         if (!GoalUtils.hasGroundPathNavigation(this.mob)) {
             return false;
         }
